<li><strong>12+ embedding models</strong>: BGE, E5, mpnet, InstructorXL, BGE-M3 + BYO OpenAI/Cohere/Voyage</li>
<li><strong>Python-first API</strong>: collection.add() / query() / get() one-liners, ideal for Jupyter prototyping</li>
