<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-4">Chroma's HNSW index implementation (inherited from hnswlib) is competitive on small-to-medium workloads. Verified benchmarks from Chroma team and third-party reproductions (approximate, 2026-07-28):</p>

